        "x1": 179.6,
        "tag": "title",
        "text": "A Feeling unwell"
      },
      {
        "y": 88.4,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 383.9,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "Some informal expressions that mean ‘not well, but not seriously ill’."
      },
      {
        "y": 100,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 312.8,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "A: You look a bit off-colour today. Are you all right?"
      },
      {
        "y": 112,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 363.8,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "B: I’m just feeling a bit out of sorts, it’s nothing to worry about."
      },
      {
        "y": 124,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 386,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "I was feeling a bit under the weather, so I stayed at home yesterday."
      },
      {
        "y": 136,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 259.3,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "Katy’s been feeling poorly for a while."
      },
      {
        "y": 148,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 333.9,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "I’m fighting off a cold at the moment. [trying to get rid of]"
      },
      {
        "y": 160,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 446.8,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "Rani isn’t in today; she’s gone down with flu. [has caught, usually a non-serious illness]"
      },
      {
        "y": 172,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 509.3,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "I’m not going to work today. I’ve come down with a dreadful cold. (we usually say come down, not"
      },
      {
        "y": 184.4,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 285.8,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "go down with, when talking about ourselves)"
      },
      {
        "y": 196,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 507,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "Harry suffers from hay fever and sneezes a lot if he’s near grass or flowers. [used for more long-term"
      },
      {
        "y": 209.4,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 137.8,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "problems]"
      },
      {
        "y": 229.3,
        "x0": 74.7,
        "x1": 430.9,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "B Minor health problems Language help"
      },
      {
        "y": 246.9,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 254.4,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "Note that hurt is different from ache:"
      },
      {
        "y": 253.8,
        "x0": 337.7,
        "x1": 508.5,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "You can call a physical pain a dull/nagging/"
      },
      {
        "y": 258.9,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 294,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "My arm hurts where I banged it against the car"
      },
      {
        "y": 265.8,
        "x0": 337.7,
        "x1": 504,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "throbbing ache but the noun hurt refers to"
      },
      {
        "y": 271.3,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 241.3,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "door. [gives pain caused by an injury]"
      },
      {
        "y": 277.8,
        "x0": 337.7,
        "x1": 499.7,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "emotional pain, e.g. The break-up of their"
      },
      {
        "y": 282.9,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 291.9,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "My back aches after all that digging yesterday."
      },
      {
        "y": 289.5,
        "x0": 337.7,
        "x1": 499.1,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "relationship caused them both deep hurt."
      },
      {
        "y": 296.2,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 196.8,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "[persistent low-level pain]"
      },
      {
        "y": 306.9,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 306.8,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "The fixed expression (the usual) aches and pains"
      },
      {
        "y": 319.3,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 498.4,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "is often used to refer in a non-serious way to minor problems: Mum’s feeling fine, apart from the"
      },
      {
        "y": 330.9,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 292.7,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "usual aches and pains (NOT pains and aches)."
      },
      {
        "y": 342.9,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 515.1,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "The fixed expression cuts and bruises can refer to minor injuries: Jason had a few cuts and bruises"
      },
      {
        "y": 355.3,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 366.4,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "when he fell off his bike, nothing serious (NOT bruises and cuts)."
      },
      {
        "y": 367.3,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 270,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "Some other kinds of physical discomfort:"
      },
      {
        "y": 378.9,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 421.7,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "My hand’s been stinging ever since I touched that plant. [sudden, burning pain]"
      },
      {
        "y": 390.9,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 265.2,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "My head is throbbing. [beating with pain]"
      },
      {
        "y": 402.9,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 500.9,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "I have a stiff neck from sitting in a draught yesterday. [pain and difficulty in moving your neck round]"
      },
      {
        "y": 414.9,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 473.5,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "She tripped on the uneven pavement and twisted her ankle. [injured by turning it suddenly]"
      },
      {
        "y": 426.9,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 487.1,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "I feel a bit dizzy. I think I should sit down. [a feeling that you are spinning round and can’t balance]"
      },
      {
        "y": 438.9,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 482.8,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "She was a bit feverish this morning, so I told her to stay in bed. [with a high temperature/fever]"
      },
      {
        "y": 450.9,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 480.4,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "I feel quite shivery / hot and cold. I think I must have a temperature. [shaking slightly, usually"
      },
      {
        "y": 464.2,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 169.9,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "because of a fever]"
      },
      {
        "y": 474.9,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 366,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "I’ve had a lot of sleepless nights recently. [without sleeping much]"
      },
      {
        "y": 486.9,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 507.6,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "I had a terrible nauseous feeling after taking the medicine, but it passed. [/ˈnɔːziəs/ feeling that you"
      },
      {
        "y": 500.2,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 154.3,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "want to vomit]"
      },
      {
        "y": 510.9,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 403.3,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "He was trembling all over; I knew it must be something serious. [shaking]"
      },
      {
        "y": 522.9,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 399.3,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "My nose is all bunged up today with this horrible cold. [blocked; informal]"
      },
      {
        "y": 544.2,
        "x0": 75,
        "x1": 177,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "C Getting better"
      },
      {
        "y": 561.7,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 405.6,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "I had a virus last week, but I got over it quite quickly. [got better, recovered]"
      },
      {
        "y": 573.7,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 446.5,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "Jo’s recovering from a major operation. [getting better: used for more serious illnesses]"
      },
      {
        "y": 585.7,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 382.7,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "Dan felt terrible last week, but he’s on the mend now. [getting better]"
      },
      {
        "y": 597.7,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 463.8,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "It’s taking Hania some time to recover from her accident, but she’s over the worst now."
      },
